WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.717
Want something changed?

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.597
Just tell the assistant.

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:07.117
Rhodo saves your feedback on tone, terminology,

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.937
and how you describe your work,

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.807
and uses it to guide future drafts.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.627
Your pursue and decline decisions sharpen the scoring, too.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.433
So with every pursuit, the writing sounds more like your team.
